OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fmostly clear skies, leading to a
OL,7,Fchilly night with light winds. A grass
OL,8,Ffrost is possible by dawn for any
OL,9,Fprone rural spots.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FAnother dry and sunny day with
OL,12,Fgenerally cloudless skies. Patchy mist
OL,13,Fand fog possible overnight.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,16,FVariable cloud and sunny spells
OL,17,FTuesday. Outbreaks of rain expected
OL,18,Ffor a time Wednesday. Fine and sunny
OL,19,FThursday. Warm by day, but chilly
OL,20,FWednesday and Thursday nights.
